<tr><td>3</td><td>ArrayList(Collection c)</td><td>Equivalent ArrayList from any collection object</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Property</th><th>Evidence in demo</th></tr>
<tr><td>Insertion order preserved</td><td>Elements appear in add order</td></tr>
<tr><td>Duplicates allowed</td><td>Two 10 values coexist</td></tr>
<tr><td>Null insertion possible</td><td>null added successfully</td></tr>
<tr><td>Heterogeneous objects</td><td>Integer + String in same list</td></tr>
<tr><td>Index-based remove</td><td>remove(2) removes by index</td></tr>
<tr><td>Index-based add</td><td>add(2, &quot;Software&quot;) shifts existing elements</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Type</th><th>toString output style</th><th>Example</th></tr>
